01d9ea81bd11d958,https://openalex.org/W4391591172,https://openalex.org/W7133187299,CompeteSMoE -- Effective Training of Sparse Mixture of Experts via Competition,VLMo: Unified Vision-Language Pre-Training with Mixture-Of-Modality-Experts,1,Introduction,author_year,unknown,"In recent years, LLMs have shown a remarkable success in solving many cognitive tasks, ranging from language, vision understanding (Bao et al., 2022b; Gulati et al., 2020; Dosovitskiy et al., 2021; Ruiz et al., 2021; Bao et al., 2022a; Li et al., 2022; 2023), to code generation (Wang et al., 2021), *Co last authors 1Singapore Management University 2University of Tennessee at Chattanooga 3Department of Statistics and Data Sciences, University of Texas at Austin, USA 4School of Mathematics an","two transformer architectures and a wide range of tasks demonstrate the efficacy, robustness, and scalability of CompeteSMoE compared to state-of-the-art SMoE strategies. 1. Introduction Large language models (LLMs) have emerged as a promising framework for artificial general intelligence. In recent years, LLMs have shown a remarkable success in solving many cognitive tasks, ranging from language, vision understanding (Bao et al., 2022b; Gulati et al., 2020; Dosovitskiy et al., 2021; Ruiz et al., 2021; Bao et al., 2022a; Li et al., 2022; 2023), to code generation (Wang et al., 2021), *Co last authors 1Singapore Management University 2University of Tennessee at Chattanooga 3Department of Statistics and Data Sciences, University of Texas at Austin, USA 4School of Mathematics and Physics, The University of Queensland 5Salesforce Research 6AISIA Lab, Univers",https://arxiv.org/pdf/2402.02526#page=1,heuristic_unvalidated,1652
