fd2182f32ae626ff,https://openalex.org/W4396815229,https://openalex.org/W4402671950,"DeepSeek-V2: A Strong, Economical, and Efficient Mixture-of-Experts Language Model",DeepSeekMoE: Towards Ultimate Expert Specialization in Mixture-of-Experts Language Models,1,unresolved,name,unknown,DeepSeek-V2 adopts innovative architectures including Multi-head Latent Attention (MLA) and DeepSeekMoE.,"Mixture-of-Experts Language Model DeepSeek-AI research@deepseek.com Abstract We present DeepSeek-V2, a strong Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) language model characterized by economical training and efficient inference. It comprises 236B total parameters, of which 21B are activated for each token, and supports a context length of 128K tokens. DeepSeek-V2 adopts innovative architectures including Multi-head Latent Attention (MLA) and DeepSeekMoE. MLA guarantees efficient inference through significantly compressing the Key-Value (KV) cache into a latent vector, while DeepSeekMoE enables training strong models at an economical cost through sparse computation. Compared with DeepSeek 67B, DeepSeek-V2 achieves significantly stronger performance, and meanwhile saves 42.5% of training costs, reduces the KV cache by 93.3%, and boosts the maximum generation throughput to 5.76",https://arxiv.org/pdf/2405.04434#page=1,heuristic_unvalidated,478
2b4f44ecbdbd9eac,https://openalex.org/W4396815229,https://openalex.org/W4402671950,"DeepSeek-V2: A Strong, Economical, and Efficient Mixture-of-Experts Language Model",DeepSeekMoE: Towards Ultimate Expert Specialization in Mixture-of-Experts Language Models,1,unresolved,name,unknown,"MLA guarantees efficient inference through significantly compressing the Key-Value (KV) cache into a latent vector, while DeepSeekMoE enables training strong models at an economical cost through sparse computation.","language model characterized by economical training and efficient inference. It comprises 236B total parameters, of which 21B are activated for each token, and supports a context length of 128K tokens. DeepSeek-V2 adopts innovative architectures including Multi-head Latent Attention (MLA) and DeepSeekMoE. MLA guarantees efficient inference through significantly compressing the Key-Value (KV) cache into a latent vector, while DeepSeekMoE enables training strong models at an economical cost through sparse computation. Compared with DeepSeek 67B, DeepSeek-V2 achieves significantly stronger performance, and meanwhile saves 42.5% of training costs, reduces the KV cache by 93.3%, and boosts the maximum generation throughput to 5.76 times. We pretrain DeepSeek-V2 on a high-quality and multi-source corpus consisting of 8.1T tokens, and further perform Supervised Fin",https://arxiv.org/pdf/2405.04434#page=1,heuristic_unvalidated,613
