c67b8a6254dcdd03,https://openalex.org/W4404782031,https://openalex.org/W4226515448,LLaMA-MoE: Building Mixture-of-Experts from LLaMA with Continual Pre-Training,DeepSpeed-MoE: Advancing Mixture-of-Experts Inference and Training to Power Next-Generation AI Scale,7,Model,author_year,unknown,"Our implementation is based on transformers (Wolf et al., 2020), ZeRO-1 (Rajbhandari et al., 2022), and FlashAttention v2 (Dao, 2023).","e different MoE construction strategies. All models are trained on 112 A100 (80G) GPUs with a global batch size of 15M tokens. The context length is 4096. The maximum learning rate is 2e-4 with 100 warmup steps and the final learning rate decays to 2e-5 with cosine scheduling. Each LLaMA-MoE variant is expected to be trained on 200B tokens (13.6k steps). Our implementation is based on transformers (Wolf et al., 2020), ZeRO-1 (Rajbhandari et al., 2022), and FlashAttention v2 (Dao, 2023). The final LLaMA-MoE models are trained on IndependentRandom with StaticSheared data sampling weights and fluency-filtered SlimPajama datasets. More details can be found in our released code. 5.4 Main Results As shown in Table 2, LLaMA-MoE-3.5B (2/8) and LLaMA-MoE-3.5B (4/16) achieve similar average results and the latter is slightly better. However, LLaMA-MoE-3.5B significantly surpasses o",https://arxiv.org/pdf/2406.16554#page=7,heuristic_unvalidated,21029
