42784d7e41938163,https://openalex.org/W4408858386,https://openalex.org/W3138895808,A Survey on Mixture of Experts in Large Language Models,FastMoE: A Fast Mixture-of-Expert Training System,20,Training,numeric,unknown,"Therefore, recent studies like DeepSpeed-MoE [64], FastMoE [129], HetuMoE [134] and Tutel [130] have focused on the development of tailored GPU kernels to enhance the efficiency of MoE operations.","al overhead through operations including gate routing, input encode, and output decode. Unlike expert computations, which mirror operations in dense models and benefit from extensive optimization on prevalent hardware such as GPUs, these MoE operations are characterized by redundant computation and memory movement, resulting in low efficiency on computing devices. Therefore, recent studies like DeepSpeed-MoE [64], FastMoE [129], HetuMoE [134] and Tutel [130] have focused on the development of tailored GPU kernels to enhance the efficiency of MoE operations. In contexts where multiple experts are deployed on a single GPU device, MegaBlocks [137] reformulates MoE computation in terms of block-sparse operations, developing specialized block-sparse GPU kernels that efficiently handle the dynamic workloads without dropping tokens. Zheng et al. [139]",https://arxiv.org/pdf/2407.06204#page=20,heuristic_unvalidated,103878
