e3a2d6deca0f3603,https://openalex.org/W4408858386,https://openalex.org/W4386260498,A Survey on Mixture of Experts in Large Language Models,PipeMoE: Accelerating Mixture-of-Experts through Adaptive Pipelining,21,Training,name,unknown,"In addition, MPipeMoE [142] introduces a strategy to reduce the memory overhead associated with activations and temporary buffers.","retain only essential non-expert parameters and the active expert parameters within the GPU’s HighBandwidth Memory (HBM), offloading inactive expert parameters to CPU memory or SSDs. These patterns incur additional overhead from data transfer across the storage hierarchy, thus they integrate expert selection forecasting and expert parameter prefetching techniques to overlap parameter access with computation. In addition, MPipeMoE [142] introduces a strategy to reduce the memory overhead associated with activations and temporary buffers. This is achieved by sharing buffer for various partitions of tensors, while leveraging recomputation/communication and CPU offloading to recover the requisite activations in the backward pass. 6 APPLICATIONS OF MIXTURE OF EXPERTS In the current landscape dominated by Transformer-based large language models (LLMs), th",https://arxiv.org/pdf/2407.06204#page=21,heuristic_unvalidated,110450
