132a0eeed0f182ab,https://openalex.org/W4410427444,https://openalex.org/W4396815229,DeepSeek: Paradigm Shifts and Technical Evolution in Large AI Models,"DeepSeek-V2: A Strong, Economical, and Efficient Mixture-of-Experts Language Model",6,Training,name,unknown,"For SFT, a 1.5M-scale multidomain instruction dataset is synthesized using expert models (derived from internal DeepSeek-R1 variants) for reasoning tasks and DeepSeek-V2.5 for non-reasoning tasks.","e density of training signals and thereby enhancing text generation capabilities. These innovations enable the creation of the powerful DeepSeek-V3-Base model with reduced training costs. In the post-training phase, SFT and RL are performed, resulting in DeepSeek-V3. For SFT, a 1.5M-scale multidomain instruction dataset is synthesized using expert models (derived from internal DeepSeek-R1 variants) for reasoning tasks and DeepSeek-V2.5 for non-reasoning tasks. For RL, GRPO [41] is employed to reduce GPU memory usage and accelerate training. Reward modeling combines rule-based and model-based approaches tailored to different problem types. This phase enhances the performance of DeepSeek-V3-Base, as well as aligning it with human preference, yielding the final DeepSeek-V3. 2) DeepSeek-R1 series: The DeepSeek-R1 series is a set of advanced AI models based on",https://arxiv.org/pdf/2507.09955#page=6,heuristic_unvalidated,31382
a6fc75642aae2721,https://openalex.org/W4410427444,https://openalex.org/W4396815229,DeepSeek: Paradigm Shifts and Technical Evolution in Large AI Models,"DeepSeek-V2: A Strong, Economical, and Efficient Mixture-of-Experts Language Model",10,Training,numeric,unknown,"One key innovation is the MLA mechanism [42], which helps in reducing the KV cache size during inference.","memory usage. Furthermore, the model shares parameters between the main model and the MTP modules, such as the embedding layer and output head, effectively reducing the memory requirements for these layers without compromising performance. C. Efficiency Breakthroughs in Inference Phase The inference acceleration framework integrates attention optimization and MoE system enhancements. One key innovation is the MLA mechanism [42], which helps in reducing the KV cache size during inference. This is achieved by applying low-rank joint compression to the attention keys and values, which drastically reduces the memory footprint required for caching. During inference, only compressed versions of the keys and values are cached, minimizing the storage requirements. This reduction is crucial for LLMs where memory usage can become a bottleneck. Similar com-",https://arxiv.org/pdf/2507.09955#page=10,heuristic_unvalidated,52131
087f0df6ca314db8,https://openalex.org/W4410427444,https://openalex.org/W4402671950,DeepSeek: Paradigm Shifts and Technical Evolution in Large AI Models,DeepSeekMoE: Towards Ultimate Expert Specialization in Mixture-of-Experts Language Models,2,unresolved,name,unknown,"• The core technical innovations of DeepSeek, mainly including MLA, DeepSeekMoE, MTP, and GRPO, are presented.","omputational resources. This paper summarizes the paradigm shift in LLM research and analyzes the technological evolution stemming from the development of the DeepSeek series of models. The main contributions are as follows: • The mainstream LLM paradigm and its evolution are summarized. The paradigm shift introduced by the DeepSeek series models is analyzed. • The core technical innovations of DeepSeek, mainly including MLA, DeepSeekMoE, MTP, and GRPO, are presented. Additionally, engineering optimizations across the training phase, inference phase, and system-level architecture are outlined. • The impact of DeepSeek models on various fields is examined, and future development trends in LLM research are discussed. In the remainder of this paper, the LLM paradigm and its evolution are first presented. Next, the algorithmic innovations and engineering optimi",https://arxiv.org/pdf/2507.09955#page=2,heuristic_unvalidated,10501
