0484fd8f2e530121,https://openalex.org/W4417068622,https://openalex.org/W3119866685,S2MoE: Robust Sparse Mixture of Experts via Stochastic Learning,Switch Transformers: Scaling to Trillion Parameter Models with Simple and Efficient Sparsity,3,Methodology,author_year,unknown,"Same as (Fedus et al., 2022), (Chi et al., 2022a), we propose the training objective with jointly minimizing the loss of the target task, an auxiliary balancing loss (Lb ) and a below uncertainty loss (Lu ).","neration, as illustrated in Figure 2. The output of the S2MoE layer is defined by the following equation: fS2MoE(x) = g (x) fSMoE(x) + (1 −g (x))fSMoE(ˆx), (3) Here, g(x) represents a gating network that combines the SMoE outputs from the original input and the feature-augmented input. The term 1 −g(x) reflects the model’s trade-off between focusing on learning the original features and exploring new ones Learning. Same as (Fedus et al., 2022), (Chi et al., 2022a), we propose the training objective with jointly minimizing the loss of the target task, an auxiliary balancing loss (Lb ) and a below uncertainty loss (Lu ). For learning under uncertainty, following previous works (Vo et al., 2018; Lee et al., 2021; Chen et al., 2024), we adopt InfoNCE (van den Oord et al., 2019) loss to control the similar between the original input and the noiseaugmented input",https://arxiv.org/pdf/2503.23007#page=3,heuristic_unvalidated,8806
