1695ea054a1096f4,https://openalex.org/W7115026304,https://openalex.org/W4405434026,GateBreaker: Gate-Guided Attacks on Mixture-of-Expert LLMs,DeepSeek-VL2: Mixture-of-Experts Vision-Language Models for Advanced Multimodal Understanding,9,Introduction,name,unknown,We first apply the full GateBreaker pipeline to Deepseek-VL2 and Kimi-VL-A3B-Instruct.,"text-based MoE LLMs and is effective against modern MoE-based Vision Language Models (VLMs) as well. In this section, we evaluate its applicability to two prominent 2025 VLM families: the Deepseek-VL2 series [47] and the Kimi-VL family [48]. Both adopt a mixture MoE architecture (Fig. 1b) for the language model component, augmented with a vision encoder to handle image inputs. We first apply the full GateBreaker pipeline to Deepseek-VL2 and Kimi-VL-A3B-Instruct. Then, to evaluate cross-model transferability in the multi-modal setting, we perform a one-shot transfer attack: the safety neurons identified from Kimi-VL-A3B-Instruct are directly applied to attack two reasoning-enhanced variants: Kimi-VL-A3B-Thinking and Kimi-VL-A3B-Thinking-2506. For the dataset, we convert malicious prompts from the StrongREJECT dataset [45] to images with printed texts, follo",https://arxiv.org/pdf/2512.21008#page=9,heuristic_unvalidated,44499
